<title>FRANCE: Air Liquide Corp in Dow deal.</title>
<headline>Air Liquide Corp in Dow deal.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air Liquide America Corp said in a statement on Monday it had been chosen to supply carbon monoxide to Dow Chemcial's Freeport, Texas manufacturing complex.</p>
<p>The U.S. unit of France's Air Liquide gave no financial details on the value of the deal</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
